# A2ML Profile: a2ml/ecosystem

@abstract:
Validation profile for the descriptiles ECOSYSTEM.a2ml metadata record (position in
the ecosystem and related projects). Non-executable; five-axis-bounded per
SPEC.adoc Section 8.2.
@end

@profile-def(id=a2ml/ecosystem, version="1.0.0"):
required_sections:
  - metadata
  - project
  - position-in-ecosystem
allowed_directives: closed [ profile ]
required_directives: []
reference_classes: []
min_attestation: checked
@end

# Notes

@rationale:
ECOSYSTEM situates the repo among its siblings. `project` (name/role) and
`position-in-ecosystem` (category) are the minimum needed to place it;
`related-projects` is optional because a standalone or newly-seeded repo may
have no recorded relationships yet.
@end
